# The IMU stops answering while the robot is held tilted sideways (2026-10-28, an audit: a reading that froze still
# counted as fresh - the robot would feel tilted for ever). The tilt must fade once the readings stop.
duration 6:00
clock 14:00
seed 5
room_light on
owner home
at 0:05 person owner enter 0 0.6
at 1:00 pick_up 0 35
at 1:20 fault imu on
at 1:30 put_down
